<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-danio-rerio-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Danio rerio Holocene 24.08 µm anisotropic Schnakenberg wavelength (pass 2) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure now places the fish-mask composite next to the photograph, and the GIF stripes are bimodal in the specimen dark/light palette rather than a gray sinusoid. Computer-vision similarity rose from 74.5 to 77.8. The eye, blue iridescence, and the adult count of four or five stripes are still absent; the composite shows the six wavelengths of the 144.48 µm window." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
